<header class="ref-head cen-head"><p class="cty-kicker">History by century · The 900s BCE</p><h1 class="research-title">The 10th century BCE</h1><p class="ref-lede">In the 900s BCE, 166 recorded states existed somewhere in the world. 55 were founded and 9 came to an end. The great powers of the age included the Western Zhou, the Assyrian Empire and the Elamite Confederation.</p></header>
